{"seq":3,"slug":"modular-layering-strategies","title":"模块化分层策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/application-structure/modular-layering-strategies","wordCount":872,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"模块化分层策略\">模块化分层策略</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>模块化分层是将大型前端代码库拆分为独立、可组合模块的实践。不同于 FSD 的标准化规范或 Clean Architecture 的理论框架，本文聚焦实际项目中的模块边界设计——如何利用 monorepo 工具链、TypeScript 路径映射和构建工具能力，构建从小型项目平滑扩展到大型平台的渐进式分层方案。核心目标是：每个模块有明确的职责边界、最小的外部依赖、独立的测试和构建能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"模块化的三个维度\">模块化的三个维度</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;Dimension 1: Vertical Slicing&quot;&#10;        V1[&quot;Feature Module A&quot;]&#10;        V2[&quot;Feature Module B&quot;]&#10;        V3[&quot;Feature Module C&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Dimension 2: Horizontal Layering&quot;&#10;        H1[&quot;UI Layer&quot;]&#10;        H2[&quot;Logic Layer&quot;]&#10;        H3[&quot;Data Layer&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Dimension 3: Package Boundary&quot;&#10;        P1[&quot;@app/shared&quot;]&#10;        P2[&quot;@app/feature-auth&quot;]&#10;        P3[&quot;@app/feature-dashboard&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"Dimension 1: Vertical Slicing\"\n        V1[\"Feature Module A\"]\n        V2[\"Feature Module B\"]\n        V3[\"Feature Module C\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Dimension 2: Horizontal Layering\"\n        H1[\"UI Layer\"]\n        H2[\"Logic Layer\"]\n        H3[\"Data Layer\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Dimension 3: Package Boundary\"\n        P1[\"@app/shared\"]\n        P2[\"@app/feature-auth\"]\n        P3[\"@app/feature-dashboard\"]\n    end</pre><p><strong>垂直切片</strong>：按业务功能划分模块。每个功能是一个独立单元，包含自己的 UI、逻辑和数据层。</p>\n<p><strong>水平分层</strong>：在垂直切片内部，按技术职责分层。UI 组件、业务逻辑、数据访问各有清晰边界。</p>\n<p><strong>包边界</strong>：使用 monorepo 的 package 机制或 TypeScript 路径别名，将模块之间的依赖关系显式化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"模块边界的强制手段\">模块边界的强制手段</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>强度</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>目录约定</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>小型项目</td>\n<td>文档 + Code Review</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeScript paths</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中型项目</td>\n<td>tsconfig.json</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ESLint import rules</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中型项目</td>\n<td>eslint-plugin-import</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Package boundaries</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>大型项目</td>\n<td>pnpm workspace / Turborepo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独立构建产物</td>\n<td>最强</td>\n<td>超大型</td>\n<td>Module Federation</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"渐进式分层-从简单到复杂\">渐进式分层：从简单到复杂</h3><p><strong>阶段 1：单体应用内部分层</strong>（1-3 人团队）</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"src/&#10;├── modules/&#10;│   ├── auth/&#10;│   │   ├── components/     # 仅 auth 相关的 UI&#10;│   │   ├── hooks/          # auth 状态和逻辑&#10;│   │   ├── api/            # auth API 调用&#10;│   │   ├── types.ts        # auth 类型定义&#10;│   │   └── index.ts        # Public API&#10;│   ├── products/&#10;│   │   ├── components/&#10;│   │   ├── hooks/&#10;│   │   ├── api/&#10;│   │   └── index.ts&#10;│   └── cart/&#10;│       ├── components/&#10;│       ├── hooks/&#10;│       ├── api/&#10;│       └── index.ts&#10;├── shared/                  # 跨模块共享&#10;│   ├── ui/                  # 设计系统组件&#10;│   ├── utils/               # 工具函数&#10;│   └── api/                 # API 客户端基础&#10;└── app/                     # 应用入口和路由&#10;    ├── routes.tsx&#10;    └── providers.tsx\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── modules/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── auth/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── components/     # 仅 auth 相关的 UI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── hooks/          # auth 状态和逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── api/            # auth API 调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── types.ts        # auth 类型定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── index.ts        # Public API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── products/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── components/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── hooks/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── api/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── cart/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── components/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── hooks/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── api/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── shared/                  # 跨模块共享</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── ui/                  # 设计系统组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── utils/               # 工具函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── api/                 # API 客户端基础</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── app/                     # 应用入口和路由</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── routes.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── providers.tsx</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>阶段 2：Monorepo 包隔离</strong>（3-10 人团队）</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"packages/&#10;├── shared/&#10;│   ├── ui/                  # @app/ui&#10;│   │   ├── src/&#10;│   │   ├── package.json&#10;│   │   └── tsconfig.json&#10;│   ├── utils/               # @app/utils&#10;│   └── api-client/          # @app/api-client&#10;├── features/&#10;│   ├── auth/                # @app/feature-auth&#10;│   │   ├── src/&#10;│   │   ├── package.json     # dependencies: @app/ui, @app/api-client&#10;│   │   └── tsconfig.json&#10;│   ├── products/            # @app/feature-products&#10;│   └── cart/                # @app/feature-cart&#10;└── apps/&#10;    ├── web/                 # 主 Web 应用&#10;    │   ├── src/&#10;    │   └── package.json     # 依赖所有 feature packages&#10;    └── admin/               # 管理后台（复用部分 features）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>packages/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── shared/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── ui/                  # @app/ui</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── tsconfig.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── utils/               # @app/utils</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── api-client/          # @app/api-client</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── features/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── auth/                # @app/feature-auth</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── package.json     # dependencies: @app/ui, @app/api-client</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── tsconfig.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── products/            # @app/feature-products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── cart/                # @app/feature-cart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── apps/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── web/                 # 主 Web 应用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   ├── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   └── package.json     # 依赖所有 feature packages</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── admin/               # 管理后台（复用部分 features）</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"monorepo-工具链配置\">Monorepo 工具链配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// pnpm-workspace.yaml&#10;packages:&#10;  - &#39;packages/shared/*&#39;&#10;  - &#39;packages/features/*&#39;&#10;  - &#39;apps/*&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// pnpm-workspace.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">packages:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - 'packages/shared</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  - 'packages/features/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  - 'apps/*'</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// packages/features/auth/package.json&#10;{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@app/feature-auth&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;0.0.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;private&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;main&quot;: &quot;./src/index.ts&quot;,&#10;  &quot;types&quot;: &quot;./src/index.ts&quot;,&#10;  &quot;dependencies&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;@app/ui&quot;: &quot;workspace:*&quot;,&#10;    &quot;@app/api-client&quot;: &quot;workspace:*&quot;,&#10;    &quot;@app/utils&quot;: &quot;workspace:*&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// packages/features/auth/package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@app/feature-auth\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0.0.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"private\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"main\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src/index.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src/index.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"dependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@app/ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"workspace:*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@app/api-client\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"workspace:*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@app/utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"workspace:*\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// turbo.json - Turborepo 构建编排&#10;{&#10;  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;https://turbo.build/schema.json&quot;,&#10;  &quot;tasks&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: [&quot;dist/**&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;test&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;lint&quot;: {},&#10;    &quot;typecheck&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// turbo.json - Turborepo 构建编排</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://turbo.build/schema.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tasks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></sp